"midpoints.allmidpoints.help"           = "An overview of all midpoints, sorted in zodiacal order. Each midpoint is calculated via the shortest arc between two factors.\n\nOn the left you see both factors, followed by the position of the midpoint they form.\n\nClick 'Occupied midpoints' to see which midpoints are actually occupied.";
